# brand/ is generated by brand-pipeline/build.py and every file in it is traced
# by sha256 in brand/MANIFEST.json. core.autocrlf is true on the build machine,
# so without this line git would rewrite LF to CRLF on checkout, the bytes on
# disk would stop matching the recorded hash, and every pipeline rerun would
# report the whole bundle as modified. Leave these bytes alone.
brand/** -text
